WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:18.000
Choose the Ball sprite. Name it Ball 1 and set its size to 150.

00:18.000 --> 00:37.000
Duplicate Ball 1. Name the copy goal 1.

00:37.000 --> 01:04.000
Open Costumes. Turn Fill off and choose an orange Outline.

01:04.000 --> 01:21.000
Check that Ball 1 is full and goal 1 is an empty orange ring.
